ldog</b> is a hotdog covered in green mold, similar in texture to Mythril. \n</p><p>Despite being of similar nature, <b>Moldog</b> uses a unique model, unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Hotdog\" title=\"Hotdog\">Hotdog</a> that uses a Roblox gear \"Hotdog\" as it's model.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163423\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019427/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.828      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   37.828      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2327-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163423 and revision id 17896. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items"],"links":[{"title":"Hotdog","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true}],"images":["Moldog.png"]}
